elementary Terminal 8.1.0 on gvt instead of VTE.

gvt (packages/gvt) copies the part of VTE 0.84's Vte.Terminal API that
elementary uses, under the namespace Gvt, so the port is a rename. Comments
that describe VTE's behaviour are left as they were.

Files and hunks:
- meson.build: vte_dep is dependency('gvt-1') instead of vte-2.91-gtk4.
  The variable keeps its name, so src/meson.build is untouched.
- src/MainWindow.vala, on_terminal_child_exited: Vte.Terminal -> Gvt.Terminal.
- src/Widgets/SearchToolbar.vala, search_changed (2 hunks): the cast to
  Gvt.Terminal, and Gvt.Regex.for_search takes search_term as it is. gvt
  searches for a literal, so GLib.Regex.escape_string would make it look
  for the backslashes. The PCRE2 flags still compile and are ignored.
- src/Widgets/TerminalWidget.vala (6 hunks): the base class, the cursor
  shape cast, get_user_shell, PtyFlags, Regex.for_match and Format, each
  Vte. -> Gvt.

